  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Irrigation project to improve the seeds for agriculture in communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthen the socioeconomic capacity of 30 women. To promote training related to agricultural cooperatives, management of community funds, basic accounting, trade, financing of small economic initiatives, rural entrepreneurship, and acquisition of improved seeds, among others. Working through an agriculture cooperative in the village.</narrative>
